Attach UE with operator specific qci and send ul dl traffic
    Call Setup
    ...    5g=5g_basic_setup_cfg:data
    ...    parallel=${False}
    ...    verify_attach=${False}
    ...    attach=${False}
    ...    timeout=300
    Sleep    60
    Configure UE    5g=5g_basic_setup_cfg:data    command=ue_register    id=1    profile=1
    sleep    10
    Configure UE    5g=5g_basic_setup_cfg:data    command=set_pdu_param    ue=1    pdu=1    trf_type=internal
    sleep    10
    Configure UE    5g=5g_basic_setup_cfg:data    command=ue_pdu_session_setup    pdu=1    ue=1    nwslice=1    gw=1
    sleep    10
